# LF in the repository for everything text, so the C sources and the Makefile
# are one spelling whatever checked them out.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Except what DOS parses: COMMAND.COM wants CRLF and mis-parses a lone LF, and
# DOSBUILD.BAT is the build that matters here. Both spellings of the extension,
# because pattern matching is only case insensitive on a case insensitive
# filesystem and the file is DOSBUILD.BAT.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.BAT text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
